{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》龔慈恩與姜大衛相隔29年再度「神顏同框」 演舊情人鬥飆戲引爆集體回憶。</p><p>昨晚劇情講述，姜大衛為了成為LKS區域首席總監，處心積慮找來分手多年的舊情人龔慈恩。</p><p>不少網民翻出姜大衛及龔慈恩昔日舊照，大讚二人是一代俊男美女。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.724510+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:12:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.628203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.628203+00:00","content_hash":"3c2c56dbb524180b834456796c764564ee7e6ed66f99bf4f20435bc4f0b7d487","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}